Base: 84710728 (github.com/jesdga95/basalt). Apply in ~/lab/basalt: git apply ~/llama-swap/basalt/patches/responses-input-tokens.patch
Upstream PR: https://github.com/jesdga95/basalt/pull/381 (opened 2026-11-15); drop this patch once it is merged and pulled.

